  - [ ] Issue #10 (https://github.com/sqxy090123/Kronyx/issues/10)
- [Medium] 三元运算符左结合 (parser.c:273)：`{ "?", 11, 0 }` 应为 `{ "?", 11, 1 }`；`a?b:c?d:e` 被解析为 `(a?b:c)?d:e` 而非 `a?b:(c?d:e)`
